etres Pursuit, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "350024"} "15 kilometres Mass Start, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "350025"} "20 kilometres, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "350026"} "4 × 7.5 kilometres Relay, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "350027"} "7.5 kilometres Sprint, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "350028"} "10 kilometres Pursuit, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "350029"} "12.5 kilometres Mass Start, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "350031"} "4 × 6 kilometres Relay, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "350032"} "2 × 6 kilometres and 2 × 7.5 kilometres Relay, Mixed"]] [:script {} "$('#same_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "1557"} "1992"] "\n" [:option {:value "1568"} "1994"] "\n" [:option {:value "1580"} "1998"] "\n" [:option {:value "1593"} "2002"] "\n" [:option {:value "1608"} "2006"] "\n" [:option {:value "923491"} "2010"] "\n" [:option {:value "9000228"} "2018"] "\n" [:option {:value "19019638"} "2022"] "\n" [:option {:value "15000038"} "2026"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/136"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "15 kilometres, Women" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "14 February 2014 — 18:00"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/889"} "Kompleks Dlya Sorevnovaniy Po Lyzhnym Gonkam i Biatlonu Laura, Mountain Cluster, Krasnaya Polyana"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/350030"} "82 from 32 countries"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Format"] [:td {:colspan "2"} "One-minute penalty for each missed target."]] [:tr {} [:th {:valign "top"} "Details"] [:td {} "Course Length: 15,011 m" [:br {}] "Height Differential: 57 m" [:br {}] "Maximum Climb: 28 m" [:br {}] "Shooting 1: Prone at 2.985 km, 50 m range" [:br {}] "Shooting 2: Standing at 5.965 km, 50 m range" [:br {}] "Shooting 3: Prone at 8.945 km, 50 m range" [:br {}] "Shooting 4: Standing at 12.031 km, 50 m range" [:br {}] "Total Climbing: 550 m"]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "Moments after her victory in the women’s 15km individual, and becoming the first athlete from Belarus to win multiple gold medals at an Olympic Winter Games, " [:a {:href "/athletes/118516"} "Darya Domracheva"] " looked into a television camera and sent a simple message out to the world, “Happy Valentine’s Day,” as she smiled and waved her hands to the world-wide TV audience. Switzerland’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/118578"} "Selina Gasparin"] " took silver, while Domracheva’s Belorussian teammate " [:a {:href "/athletes/118564"} "Nadezhda Skardino"] " finished third."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Domracheva’s victory was her second gold medal at Sochi 2014, following her success in the 10km pursuit. The 27-year-old’s performance inspired Skardino, whose bronze medal gave Belarus a first Winter Olympic podium with two athletes on it. Gasparin’s silver was Switzerland’s first ever Olympic medal in biathlon. Many of the pre-race favorites disappointed, including Czech " [:a {:href "/athletes/118522"} "Gabriela Soukalová"] ", Norway’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/110008"} "Tora Berger"] ", Finn " [:a {:href "/athletes/118530"} "Kaisa Mäkäräinen"] ", and the German biathletes as a group."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Adjusted Time"] [:th {} "Misses"] [:th {} "Skiing"] [:th {} "Shooting 1 Misses"] [:th {} "Shooting 1"] [:th {} "Shooting 2 Misses"] [:th {} "Shooting 2"] [:th {} "Shooting 3 Misses"] [:th {} "Shooting 3"] [:th {} "Shooting 4 Misses"] [:th {} "Shooting 4"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [